    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37128" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">portātōrĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>that serves for carrying</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sella,</span>”
				<i>a sedan</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Tard. 1, 1, 15</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Christus portatoriis nubibus ascendens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. Serm. Temp. 180, 1</span></i>
			.—As <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">portātōrĭa</span></b> ,
			ae, f. (sc. sella), <i>a
				sedan chair</i>, <i><span class="en">Cael.
				Aur. Tard. 2, 13, 161</span></i>.</div>
